  m_text: 'The scout -


    A weak and deteriorated specimen that wanders aimlessly
    through the Hollow Grounds. Scouts are slow, fragile, and lack any advanced mutations,
    but their numbers make them dangerous. They are often the first sign that the
    Hollowed are approaching.'
