  m_text: 'The King of the Hollowed -


    The largest and most powerful specimen
    ever encountered. The King of the Hollowed possesses immense strength and extraordinary
    durability, capable of enduring tremendous punishment while delivering devastating
    blows. Though its massive frame makes it slow and deliberate, every step brings
    it closer to its prey, and every strike can be deadly. only few have survived
    an encounter with the King.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: aa78b33eae11b1c45957121fbd6b60ae, type: 2}
