  m_text: 'The Spitter -


    A slow-moving specimen that has developed the ability
    to launch highly toxic projectiles from a distance. The Spitter avoids close
    combat, instead keeping its distance while relentlessly attacking its targets.
    Its increased health and damage make it a dangerous threat that should never
    be left unchecked.'
